---
title: "06 | EMVA1288.lean: analysis orchestration and parameter characterization"
---
%% Focused view; repeated boundary nodes retain their original names.
flowchart TB
  MeasureSpatial["measureSpatialNonUniformity<br/>Four Image Float values plus SensorParams<br/>Returns Option NonUniformity"]
  Report["EMVA1288.Report<br/>params: SensorParams<br/>spatial: Option NonUniformity = none<br/>deriving Repr"]
  Temporal["emvaTemporalStats imgA imgB<br/>n = imgA.pixels.size<br/>Returns Float mean, Float temporal variance"]
    Caller["Library caller supplies four Image Float values in DN<br/>darkA, darkB: dark pair<br/>illumA, illumB: illuminated pair<br/>satDN: saturation digital level<br/>Acquisition and RGB-to-scalar conversion are outside this code"]
    Run["runEMVA1288Analysis<br/>Returns Option Report"]
    Characterize["characterizeFromPairs<br/>Returns Option SensorParams"]
    Delta["deltaMean = meanIllum - meanDark<br/>deltaVar = varIllum - varDark"]
    DeltaGuard{"deltaMean or deltaVar<br/>less than or equal to zero?"}
    NoParams["none: characterization failed"]
    Derive["k = deltaVar / deltaMean<br/>netDarkVar = max 0 (varDark - quantVariance)<br/>readNoiseE = sqrt netDarkVar / k<br/>satCapE = max 0 (satDN - meanDark) / k"]
    Quant["quantVariance: Float = 1 / 12<br/>One-LSB quantization variance in DN squared"]
    SomeParams["some SensorParams<br/>gainK = k; readNoise_e = readNoiseE<br/>saturationCap_e = satCapE<br/>darkOffset_DN = meanDark<br/>darkVariance_DN2 = varDark"]
    NoReport["none: no report"]
    Assemble["some Report<br/>params = characterized parameters<br/>spatial = measureSpatialNonUniformity result<br/>Spatial failure still permits a report"]
    Caller --> Run --> Characterize
    Characterize -->|two calls: dark pair and illuminated pair| Temporal
    Temporal -->|meanDark, varDark; meanIllum, varIllum| Delta
    Delta --> DeltaGuard
    DeltaGuard -->|yes| NoParams --> NoReport
    DeltaGuard -->|no| Derive --> SomeParams
    Quant --> Derive
    SomeParams -->|continue in runEMVA1288Analysis| MeasureSpatial
    SomeParams -. params field .-> Assemble
    MeasureSpatial -->|Option NonUniformity| Assemble
    Assemble -->|contains| Report
